WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.646
The certifications reveal clear and consistent winners.

00:00:03.726 --> 00:00:07.372
On Freeway,

00:00:07.452 --> 00:00:11.098
RadialRL achieves the highest certified radius
across every smoothing level,

00:00:11.178 --> 00:00:14.823
because it explicitly optimizes against worst-case
perturbations.

00:00:14.903 --> 00:00:18.549
On Pong, SA-MDP with the convex relaxation is the
most certifiably robust.

00:00:18.629 --> 00:00:22.275
Encouragingly,

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:26.001
these certified rankings largely agree with what
people had observed empirically,

00:00:26.081 --> 00:00:29.727
which builds confidence in the certificates.

00:00:29.807 --> 00:00:33.453
The analysis also surfaces new structure: on Pong
every method shows a periodic pattern

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:37.178
in its certified radius over time,

00:00:37.258 --> 00:00:40.904
with robustness peaking at confident states such as
when the ball flies toward the paddle,

00:00:40.984 --> 00:00:44.630
an insight that could guide future robust training.
